# PrimeBuild Official Store — environment template
# Copy to `.env` and fill in. NEVER commit real secrets.

# ── Product data source (Shopify, read-only) ─────────────────────────────────
# Connects the Product Builder to the live primebuildfit commercial product.
# Without these, every screen shows an honest "not connected" state.
# The token MUST be a READ-ONLY Admin API access token: the Builder role
# requires writing, but this implementation cannot write yet and refuses
# mutations in code. See docs/architecture/PRODUCT_BUILDER.md.
# SHOPIFY_STORE_DOMAIN="primebuildfit.myshopify.com"
# SHOPIFY_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN="shpat_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"
# SHOPIFY_API_VERSION="2025-01"
